title: The Chancellery
subtitle: The office of Supreme Chancellor and the powers it holds.
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor
card-image: img/card_chancellery.svg
view-if: started = 1 and not game_ending
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! SW.chancelleryStrings(Q); SW.decreeScan(Q, this); !}

= The Chancellery

[+ chan_office_html +]

**The office's powers.**

[+ chan_powers_html +]

**The government.**

[+ chan_govt_html +]

[? if chan_record > 0 : [+ chan_record_html +] ?]

[? if chan_can_decree : While the office holds emergency decrees, our Chancellor can rule by decree. Looking is free; a decree takes the turn. ?][? if rc_chancellor and not chan_can_decree : Our Chancellor holds no emergency decrees, but can still hand a power back to the Senate. ?]

- @reform: Enact a reform by decree.
- @d_arrest: The Guard arrests the corrupt.
- @d_relief: The governors deliver relief.
- @d_banks: Direct the Banking Clan.
- @d_army: Order the Grand Army forward.
- @d_address: Address the galaxy.
- @d_rival: Turn the Bureau on a rival bloc.
- @d_investigate: Set the Bureau to investigate.
- @giveback: Return a power to the Senate.
- @go_back: Back.

@reform
view-if: chan_can_decree
subtitle: A committee's next step becomes law without a vote. Faith −3; the card's own cost applies.
choose-if: dok_any = 1
unavailable-subtitle: No step can be decreed now: the committees' own conditions are not met.

= Reform by Decree

Which reform will our Chancellor enact? The Senate will be told afterwards.

