@d_arrest
view-if: chan_can_decree and chp_guard_state = "held"
subtitle: −1 political capital. Corruption −4, fear +3. Takes the turn.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.decree(Q, 'arrest'); !}

The Senate Guard moves at dawn. A dozen officials on the guilds' and the syndicates' payrolls are taken from their offices in front of the HoloNet's cameras. It is popular. It is also exactly what a Chancellor who answered to nobody would do.

@d_relief
view-if: chan_can_decree and chp_governors_state = "held"
subtitle: −1 political capital. Rim hardship −3. Takes the turn.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.decree(Q, 'relief'); !}

The sector governors are ordered to open the Republic's stores. Food and medicine reach the Rim within weeks, without a single committee hearing.

@d_banks
view-if: chan_can_decree and chp_banks_state = "held"
subtitle: −1 political capital. Debt −5. Takes the turn.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.decree(Q, 'banks'); !}

The Chancellery instructs the Banking Clan to write down the Republic's debts. The bankers comply. They also take note.

@d_army
view-if: chan_can_decree and chp_army_state = "held" and war
subtitle: −1 political capital. The weakest front +1.5. Takes the turn.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.decree(Q, 'army'); !}

Our Chancellor orders the clone army forward on the weakest front, on the office's authority alone. The clones obey at once, as they were made to.

@d_address
view-if: chan_can_decree and chp_holonet_state = "held"
subtitle: −1 political capital. The Caucus's momentum +1. Takes the turn.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.decree(Q, 'address'); !}

Every HoloNet channel carries our Chancellor's address. It is a good speech. The Office of Public Information makes sure nobody hears a reply.

@d_rival
view-if: chan_can_decree and chp_bureau_state = "held" and war_shadows_seen
subtitle: −2 political capital. A rival bloc's support, its leader's hold on it and its relations with us all suffer. Takes the turn.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.

= The Bureau's Files

The Bureau keeps files on every bloc in the Senate. Which one will it open?

- @rv_mod
- @rv_pal
- @rv_guild
- @rv_rim
- @rv_sec
- @rv_ind
- @rv_rfc
- @go_back_page

@rv_mod
title: [+ rv_mod_name +].
view-if: rv_mod_ok = 1
on-arrival: {! SW.decreeRival(Q, 'mod'); !}

The Bureau's files on the [+ decree_rival_name +] find their way to the HoloNet, one at a time: a bribe here, a lie under oath there. Their senators spend the season answering questions instead of asking them. Everyone in the Senate knows where the files came from.

